## 11. Publication checklist (before sharing this study)
- [ ] Review screenshots/ for visible PII (auto-redaction is best-effort, not exhaustive)
- [ ] derived/network-summary.json is auto-scrubbed; raw/network/* is NOT, so exclude raw/ from anything you share
- [ ] raw/network/sample_*.network-response files contain unscrubbed response bodies + bearer tokens in request headers, so **exclude them from anything shared externally**
- [ ] derived/action-trace.jsonl is auto-scrubbed
- [ ] extracted/*.md is auto-scrubbed
- [ ] If you wrote anything in notes/user-notes.md or ANALYSIS.md, review it manually
